esc_ru":"Герой призывает своего клона, который перенимает его уровень, опыт и предметы. Их способности перезаряжаются отдельно, а предметы имеют общую перезарядку (не считая свитков телепортации).\nГерой и его клоны поровну делят между собой шансы срабатывания предметов и их бонусы, увеличивающие здоровье и ману, их восстановление, урон, скорость атаки и сжигание маны, отчего их эффективность снижается на 50/66/75/80%.\nЕсли герой или любой из клонов погибнет, то умрут они все.","desc_en":"Meepo summons another Meepo, which levels up and shares items and experience with the main Meepo. Ability cooldowns are independent, but items share cooldowns between Meepos, except Teleport Scrolls.\nDamage, attack speed, health, mana, regeneration, mana burn, and proc chance bonuses from items are distributed equally among the amount of Meepos, making them 50/66/75/80% less effective.\nIf any Meepo dies, they all die.","notes_ru":[],"notes_en":[],"specials":[{"key":"tooltip_clones","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЧИСЛО КЛОНОВ:","heading_en":"NUMBER OF DUPLICATES:","values":[1.0,2.0,3.0,4.0],"percent":false},{"key":"required_level","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[3.0],"percent":false},{"key":"levels_between_upgrades","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[7.0],"percent":false},{"key":"max_level","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[4.0],"percent":false},{"key":"dps_penalty_pct","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[50.0,66.0,75.0,80.0],"percent":false}],"shard":null,"scepter":null},{"key":"meepo_geomancy","id":1763,"hero":"meepo","name_ru":"Geomancy","name_en":"Geomancy","kind":"basic","innate":true,"granted_by_scepter":false,"granted_by_shard":false,"max_level":1,"behavior":["hidden","passive"],"behavior_ru":["скрытая","пассивная"],"target_team":[],"target_type":[],"target_flags":[],"damage_type":null,"bkb_pierce":null,"immunity_code":0,"immunity":"none","dispellable":"no","cooldown":[